    {
      "abstract": "$I_{AA}$ as a function of $\\xi$ for direct photon $p_{T}^{\\gamma}$ of 5-7, 7-9, and 9-12 GeV/$c$. Three away-side integration ranges are chosen to calculate the per-trigger yield and the corresponding $I_{AA}$, $|\\Delta\\phi-\\pi|<\\pi/2$, $|\\Delta\\phi-\\pi|<\\pi/3$, and $|\\Delta\\phi-\\pi|<\\pi/6$.",
